1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
一锅红汤，酸掉一个省
One red pot sours a whole province

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,600
但它不放一滴醋
And not a single drop of vinegar

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,900
贵州红酸汤，酸味来自发酵
Guizhou's sour comes from fermenting

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,100
番茄辣椒装坛，封上五六个月
Tomato and chili, sealed for months

5
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,400
再磨浆，又发酵半个月
Then milled and fermented again

6
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,700
苗侗人说：三天不吃酸
The Miao say: three days without sour

7
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:16,000
走路都打蹿蹿
and your legs go wobbly

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,300
一勺木姜子，鲜得直窜脑门
A spoon of litsea, straight to the head

9
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,600
凯里酸汤鱼，是国家级非遗
Kaili sour-soup fish, national heritage

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,900
如今一锅酸汤，走出了大山
Now this sour pot has left the mountains

11
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:25,000
红汤新顶流，你敢喝这口酸吗？
The new star — dare you try the sour?

12
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,300
下集：一锅汤，涮下整座山
Next: one pot that cooks a whole mountain
